                        },
                        "tag": "TEXT",
                      },
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": " is the headline — it's what reclaimed end-of-shift documentation time looks like when aggregated across the unit. ",
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
