                    ],
                    "kind": "component",
                    "name": "SectionLabel",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Real-time documentation is the visibility layer that makes early intervention possible.",
                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "primitive",
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "color": "#1A1A1A",
                        "fontSize": 22,
                        "fontWeight": "bold",
                        "lineHeight": 1.2,
                        "marginBottom": 8,
                      },
                    },
                    "tag": "TEXT",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Preventable harm events don't happen because nurses don't care — they happen when risk signals are missed or delayed. The hypothesis we model: real-time flowsheet capture surfaces those signals while there's still time to act, with the actual outcome determined by clinical practice on each unit.",
                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "primitive",
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "color": "#666666",
                        "fontSize": 10.5,
                        "lineHeight": 1.5,
                        "marginBottom": 12,
                      },
                    },
                    "tag": "TEXT",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "The values below are",
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": " ",
                          },
                          {
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "kind": "text",
                                "value": "potential",
                              },
                            ],
                            "kind": "primitive",
                            "props": {
                              "style": {
                                "color": "#1A1A1A",
                                "fontWeight": "bold",
                              },
                            },
                            "tag": "TEXT",
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": " ",
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "— they require clinical practice change alongside documentation improvement. Documentation creates the visibility; the care team creates the outcome. Validate baseline rates with your infection-control and quality teams before presenting.",
                          },
                        ],
                        "kind": "primitive",
                        "props": {
                          "style": {
